{"sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","items":[{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k001","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"효소 활성은 pH와 온도에 영향을 받는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k002","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"pH는 활성자리 이온화 상태와 단백질 구조를 바꾸며 온도 상승은 일정 범위에서 반응을 빠르게 하지만 변성으로 활성이 감소할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k003","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"인산화·탈인산화는 효소에 따라 활성 또는 억제를 유발한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k004","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"단백질 절단에 의한 활성화는 소화효소 전구체와 혈액응고에서 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k005","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"효소량 조절과 효소 자체 활성 조절의 시간 규모를 구분한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k006","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"초기속도 실험에서는 생성물 축적과 역반응 영향을 최소화한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k007","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"흡광도 측정은 Beer–Lambert 법칙 A=εlc를 이용하여 농도 변화로 환산하며 대조군 및 blank가 필요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k008","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"온도, pH, 효소량, 반응부피를 일정하게 유지한 채 비교해야 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k009","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"비활성은 보통 단백질 질량당 활성으로 정의하여 정제 정도를 평가한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k010","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"인산화가 언제나 효소를 활성화하는 것은 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k011","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"효소의 최적 pH는 효소마다 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k012","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"효소 반응 속도 그래프에서 시간에 따른 생성물량의 초기 기울기가 초기속도다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--regulation-k013","sectionId":"enzyme/regulation","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"불순 단백질 제거 및 효소 일부 손실로 가능하다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}